  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-374a42c24f7d69fe919a28e2",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "1. 绘制带有常增益控制器的未校正系统根轨迹。2. 确定暂态性能指标并选取合适的主导根位置。3. 计算回路增益和未校正系统的误差常数。4. 比较误差常数，并根据零极点比值 alpha 计算所需的增益提升量。5. 在原点附近确定合适的零点与极点位置，使校正后的根轨迹通过期望根位置。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "1. Obtain the root locus of the uncompensated system with a constant gain controller. 2. Determine transient performance specifications and locate suitable dominant root locations. 3. Calculate loop gain and uncompensated error constant. 4. Compare error constants and calculate necessary increase from pole-zero ratio alpha. 5. Determine suitable pole and zero location near origin so compensated root locus passes through desired root location.",
